# ── Azure App Service log dumps ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Diagnostic bundles pulled down while debugging deployments (the LogFiles/ and
# deployments/ trees from `az webapp log download`). They are throwaway
# snapshots of a running site, not source, and each one is a few MB.
# Matched at any depth, so backend/logs5/ and backend/logs5.zip are covered too.
logs*/
logs*.zip
